---
// Contact and CTA section
---

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <div class="contact-container">
    <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Ready to collaborate? Let's talk.</p>

    <div class="contact-content">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <h3>Connect With Me</h3>
        <p>
          Interested in freelance work, technical consulting, speaking engagements, or mentoring? 
          I'd love to hear about your project or opportunity.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-methods">
          <div class="method">
            <span class="icon">📧</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Email</h4>
              <p>
                <a href="mailto:RadwaSM@hotmail.com">RadwaSM@hotmail.com</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="method">
            <span class="icon">💼</span>
            <div>
              <h4>LinkedIn</h4>
              <p>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/radwask" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  linkedin.com/in/radwask
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="method">
            <span class="icon">🛠️</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Upwork</h4>
              <p>
                <a href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015800468f01afd450" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  View my Upwork profile
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="method">
            <span class="icon">📚</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Google Scholar</h4>
              <p>
                <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=40VrQxEAAAAJ&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  View publications
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="method">
            <span class="icon">📄</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Resume</h4>
              <p>
                <a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  Download CV (PDF)
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="booking-section">
        <h3>Quick Meeting?</h3>
        <p>
          For a quick conversation, you can also book a time directly. I try to respond to inquiries 
          within 24 hours.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/radwa-s-khattab/project-collaboration-call" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule A Call</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="response-time">
      <p>
        <strong>Response time:</strong> I aim to respond to all inquiries within 24-48 hours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    background: #f8f9fa;
  }

  .contact-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .contact h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
  }

  .contact-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .contact-info h3,
  .booking-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .contact-info p,
  .booking-section p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .contact-methods {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .method {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .method .icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .method h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .method p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .method a {
    color: #64d5ff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .method a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .booking-section {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #64d5ff 0%, #4bb3ff 100%);
    color: #0f0f1e;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(100, 213, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .response-time {
    background: white;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    border-left: 4px solid #64d5ff;
  }

  .response-time p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .contact-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
